invalid: "-rpi" must be followed by a model code:
    possible code values are:
    3  (Raspberry Pi model 3 or lower, including Pi ZERO)
    30 (Raspberry Pi model 3 or lower, WITH ACTIVE COOLING)
    4  (Raspberry Pi model 4)
    40 (Raspberry Pi model 4 WITH ACTIVE COOLING)
    5  (Raspberry Pi model 5)
    50 (Raspberry Pi model 5 WITH ACTIVE COOLING)

